              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhu ndihwo ushumiri hwedzimba dzavaMerari pakushanda kwavo paTende Rokusangana vachitungamirirwa naItamari mwanakomana waAroni, muprista.\"",
          "type": "text",
